+If the server reports that this installation authorization was revoked (including after account
+deletion), `connect` removes the stale local authorization and automatic state through the normal
+cleanup path, then starts a fresh pairing without requiring `disconnect`. The installation identity
+and locally discovered source identities remain stable. Other reconciliation failures, including
+network and transient server errors, keep the existing connection and do not start pairing.
 
